# Static Netflix Page

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Netflix Clone</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #141414;
            color: white;
        }
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #e50914;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .nav-links {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .nav-links li {
            display: inline;
        }
        .nav-links a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .hero {
            height: 60vh;
            background-image: url('https://via.placeholder.com/1920x1080');
            background-size: cover;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        .btn {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #e50914;
            border: none;
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="logo">Netflix</div>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Series</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Movies</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">My List</a></li>
        </ul>
    </header>
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Unlimited Movies, TV Shows, and More.</h1>
        <p>Watch anywhere. Cancel anytime.</p>
        <button class="btn">Get Started</button>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

